      ],
      "subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE"
    },
    {
      "id": "1E81CE264FFD66B0",
      "title": "&f&lTeams and personal choices&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
        "",
        "&fThe campaign uses FTB team quest progress. Workshop stages synchronize with completed milestones when a teammate next logs in. Your skilltree class, subclass and profession investments remain personal.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fAgree on who handles crops, processing and exploration, then share the finished supplies.",
        "",
        "&c&l! WATCH OUT&r",
        "&fA teammate completing a class guide does not choose that class for you.",
        "",
        "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "75358291ED74276A"
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "601B128FBD469AA6",
          "type": "checkmark",
          "title": "Read and understand this guide"
        }
      ],
      "optional": true,
