    {
      "id": "333C4033DAE40302",
      "title": "&f&lMark home and protect it&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the project described below.",
        "",
        "&fUse the selected map and FTB Chunks tools to mark home, claim your workshop and review team permissions. Claims, loading limits and server permissions depend on the instance settings.",
        "",
        "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
        "&61. &fCreate a home waypoint.",
        "&62. &fReview your team’s claim permissions.",
        "&63. &fKeep a clear route to the workshop.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fName waypoints for farms, portals and unfinished projects, not just your main house.",
        "",
        "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
      ],
